        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wawukoli wamwanta wawaYuda Yehoyakini wamakumi asatu nakatanu nakayedi, mukakweji kekumi nakayedi, hefuku dakakwejida makumi ayedi nakatanu, mwanta wakuBabiloni Evili merodaki, hamwaka wakusambila wawanta windi hakuhindwisha mwanta wawaYuda Yehoyakini kunamutu, hakumufumisha mukaleya; ",
          "type": "text",
